     PRECISION from its three refinements. This board expands B1:
       BASE  QUIET PRECISION   = the chosen doctrine, now the reference
       QP1   RULED LEDGER      = leader dots, baseline stats, small units
       QP2   MASTHEAD          = type IS the structure; margin rails
       QP3   CARTOGRAPHIC QUIET= hairline ticks, mono captions, markers
     Shared law from B1: zero glow, state = ink + weight, boxes become
